   197                                  ; Coherent counter0 status+count: Intel8254 Read-Back 11000010b.
   198                                  ; The status is returned before the low and high count bytes. Atomic even if
   199                                  ; called with IF=1. Preserve the caller's flags (including IF), BX/CX/SI/DI.
