   240                                  ; AX=count, DL=status -> BX=phase in PIT input ticks, conditional on the
   241                                  ; documented EVEN divisor65536 assumption. In mode3 CE decreases by2 and
   242                                  ; reloads at both OUT edges: (-count mod65536)/2 + (OUT ? 0 : 32768).
   243                                  pit_phase:
