   319                                  ; Start away from IRQ0 and the mode3 half-period reload. IF is enabled during
   320                                  ; polling; the timed CLI interval has a fixed256-iteration kernel. Post-check
   321                                  ; requires an increasing phase and <=10000ticks, without a half-period edge.
   322                                  ; An abnormally stalled interval spanning whole periods cannot be certified
